Advantages of Unattended Robots
1. Reduced Human Intervention

Tasks are performed automatically without manual involvement.

Example

Automatic invoice processing.

2. Time Efficiency

Completes repetitive tasks quickly.

Example

Thousands of records processed in minutes.

3. Improved Accuracy

Reduces human errors.

Example

Accurate data entry and report generation.

4. 24/7 Availability

Works continuously, even outside office hours.

Example

Night-time data processing.

5. Centralized Monitoring

Orchestrator provides:

Execution status
Logs
Reports

Easy monitoring from a single location.

6. Scalability

Multiple robots can be deployed when workload increases.

Example

10 robots processing 10,000 invoices simultaneously.
